{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Prologue is a free intro to \u201cBurger Shift: Team Rush\u201d \ud83c\udf54 Take your first bite before the full game drops.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821150/extras/739128014cc3c9193e576cca1d3fa847.avif?t=1767800021\" width=618 height=214 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump in solo or team up with up to 8 players in co-op. Host your own session or join others through the in-game lobby, using built-in voice and text chat to stay connected as you take on the rush. <br> <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821150/extras/8738497e69a35fa3016e517952de6ca7.poster.avif?t=1767800021\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821150/extras/8738497e69a35fa3016e517952de6ca7.webm?t=1767800021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821150/extras/8738497e69a35fa3016e517952de6ca7.mp4?t=1767800021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run every part of a bustling fast food kitchen, from operating fryers and soda fountains to flipping burgers on the grill. Learn the ins and outs of each station to keep things running smoothly.  <br>  <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821150/extras/44c23ace445dc7824ca1ec739c210207.poster.avif?t=1767800021\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821150/extras/44c23ace445dc7824ca1ec739c210207.webm?t=1767800021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821150/extras/44c23ace445dc7824ca1ec739c210207.mp4?t=1767800021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expect the unexpected: chaotic events, strange customers, and surprise challenges demand quick thinking and solid teamwork. Communication and coordination are your tools for success. <br>    <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821150/extras/31b3ebae97f3411f0d4283128ea075a3.poster.avif?t=1767800021\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821150/extras/31b3ebae97f3411f0d4283128ea075a3.webm?t=1767800021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821150/extras/31b3ebae97f3411f0d4283128ea075a3.mp4?t=1767800021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay sharp and manage your time wisely. Keep orders flowing and customers happy by assigning roles, juggling priorities, and working as one unstoppable crew. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821150/extras/fe228576cd2e36a6b2a0158f33f787d4.poster.avif?t=1767800021\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821150/extras/fe228576cd2e36a6b2a0158f33f787d4.webm?t=1767800021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821150/extras/fe228576cd2e36a6b2a0158f33f787d4.mp4?t=1767800021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What\u2019s Included in the Prologue?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Order up! Here\u2019s what\u2019s on the menu in the Prologue:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-player and 1\u20138 player co-op</strong> \u2013 Run the kitchen solo or with friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A  selection of signature ingredients and recipes</strong> \u2013 Including baked goods, frying, and burger prep.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soda fountain and coffee machine</strong> \u2013 Serve cold sodas and hot coffee to keep your customers satisfied.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character customization</strong> \u2013 Pick your gear and show off your <i>style</i> with early outfit and character options.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Bite","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3821150/d9e6df7c968c28abb1750b1916f53fca58beedd0.jpg"},{"name":"Five-Star Service","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3821150/bd0467e42dde21808e9e17aea3121d826d24ff81.jpg"},{"name":"Full Shift","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3821150/8ee6afdb6f1a83a9649a0afece5132888abd6fee.jpg"},{"name":"Fresh Out the Oven","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3821150/f2bcbc271cf86bcbe335963a78dfa6ff36699b75.jpg"},{"name":"Loaded Burger","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3821150/31f89004902ea85681433eecaaf07154db7c3184.jpg"},{"name":"Morning Brew","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3821150/75faddcb2009faf0d281a8d3e65b199fac53ab6a.jpg"},{"name":"Fountain Service","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3821150/241b6a9bb2b876f31f48b6427b6d113e9046b8a8.jpg"}],"total":7},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3821150?t=1767800021","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_