_item_assets/steam/apps/3821150/extras/31b3ebae97f3411f0d4283128ea075a3.poster.avif?t=1767800021\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821150/extras/31b3ebae97f3411f0d4283128ea075a3.webm?t=1767800021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821150/extras/31b3ebae97f3411f0d4283128ea075a3.mp4?t=1767800021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay sharp and manage your time wisely. Keep orders flowing and customers happy by assigning roles, juggling priorities, and working as one unstoppable crew. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821150/extras/fe228576cd2e36a6b2a0158f33f787d4.poster.avif?t=1767800021\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821150/extras/fe228576cd2e36a6b2a0158f33f787d4.webm?t=1767800021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821150/extras/fe228576cd2e36a6b2a0158f33f787d4.mp4?t=1767800021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What\u2019s Included in the Prologue?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Order up! Here\u2019s what\u2019s on the menu in the Prologue:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-player and 1\u20138 player co-op</strong> \u2013 Run the kitchen solo or with friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A  selection of signature ingredients and recipes</strong> \u2013 Including baked goods, frying, and burger prep.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soda fountain and coffee machine</strong> \u2013 Serve cold sodas and hot coffee to keep your customers satisfied.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><stron